# Cloudflare DNS for YaPcore — yapcoremc.yaplabs.us
# Paste into Cloudflare → yaplabs.us → DNS → Records
# Replace ORIGIN_IPV4 / ORIGIN_IPV6 with this machine's public addresses.

# --- Game join (MUST be DNS only / grey cloud) ---
# Cloudflare HTTP proxy does NOT carry Minecraft TCP or Bedrock UDP.
yapcoremc.yaplabs.us.          300  IN  A      ORIGIN_IPV4     ; Proxy status: DNS only
# yapcoremc.yaplabs.us.        300  IN  AAAA   ORIGIN_IPV6     ; optional IPv6, DNS only

# Java clients can add just the hostname when SRV is published:
_minecraft._tcp.yapcoremc.yaplabs.us.  3600  IN  SRV  0 5 25565 yapcoremc.yaplabs.us.

# --- Resource packs / landing (MAY be Proxied / orange cloud) ---
# Same hostname is fine: CF terminates HTTPS → origin :80 (nginx) → YaPcore :8081
# SSL/TLS mode: Full (strict) if you put a real cert on nginx, or Flexible for HTTP origin.
# Recommended: Full + Cloudflare Origin Certificate on nginx :443 (optional later).

# Firewall / router on ORIGIN:
#   TCP+UDP 25565  → this host (nginx stream → YaPcore :25566)
#   TCP 80 (and 443 if terminating TLS locally) → nginx pack HTTP
# Do NOT expose YaPcore pack port 8081 publicly if nginx fronts it.
